    'Peekaa will create offer records for 90% of matched customers, leave 10% without an offer record for comparison, and observe return visits for 30 days. Customer contact remains manual.':'Peekaa 会为 90% 的匹配顾客创建优惠记录，保留 10% 不创建记录以作比较，并观察 30 天内的回访。顾客联系仍需手动进行。',
    'Held-back customers have no offer record, so Peekaa can compare observed return rates. This comparison alone does not prove causation. 10% is the recommended default.':'保留组顾客不会有优惠记录，因此 Peekaa 可比较观察到的回访率。仅凭此比较不能证明因果关系。建议默认保留 10%。',
