    'Self-funding by design: nothing pays out until the new customer has actually come in and spent above your floor. One reward per referred customer, ever.':'Dibiayai sendiri mengikut reka bentuk: tiada ganjaran dibayar sehingga pelanggan baharu benar-benar datang dan berbelanja melebihi ambang anda. Hanya satu ganjaran bagi setiap pelanggan yang dirujuk.',
    '"Record offers" logs each offer against the customer so the lift can be measured. To actually reach them, copy the contact list and message them on WhatsApp yourself. Held-back customers are never contacted.':'“Rekod tawaran” mencatat setiap tawaran untuk pelanggan supaya peningkatan kempen dapat diukur. Untuk menghubungi mereka, salin senarai kenalan dan hantar mesej WhatsApp sendiri. Pelanggan kumpulan kawalan tidak pernah dihubungi.',
